#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:5
#: 770055fbd9be462c973b0023bb209f85
msgid "Tuning Process Instructions"
msgstr "调参流程说明"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:7
#: df3ab9d28a504546ac07c18c125b824c
msgid ""
"This page describes the overall process to tune a Rover.  Before attempting "
"these instructions please complete the :ref:`First Time Setup <apmrover-"
"setup>` including:"
msgstr "本页介绍调节 Rover 的整体流程。在开始操作前，请先完成 :ref:`首次设置 <apmrover-setup>`，包括："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:9
#: ea96956e567843249c80ae5bdcf5c5f4
msgid ":ref:`RC calibration <common-radio-control-calibration>`"
msgstr ":ref:`遥控校准 <common-radio-control-calibration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:10
#: a1239a5de24143eabd6996ffd1f98fc7
msgid ""
":ref:`Accelerometer <common-accelerometer-calibration>` and :ref:`Compass "
"Calibration <common-compass-calibration-in-mission-planner>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`加速度计 <common-accelerometer-calibration>` 和 :ref:`罗盘校准 <common-compass-"
"calibration-in-mission-planner>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:11
#: 560edc99ab534773ad564ee01e34792d
msgid ""
":ref:`Motor and Servo calibration <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>`"
msgstr ":ref:`电机和舵机校准 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:12
#: 8e3c6811daa847e4a23235da2f483153
msgid ""
":ref:`Test the Motor Direction <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-"
"testing>` and :ref:`Minimum Throttle <rover-motor-and-servo-min-throttle>`"
msgstr ""
":ref:`测试电机方向 <rover-motor-and-servo-configuration-testing>` 和 :ref:`最小油门 "
"<rover-motor-and-servo-min-throttle>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:14
#: f3e449db452b4d19a058e08dabe5d305
msgid ""
"Setup the :ref:`Transmitter flight mode switch <common-rc-transmitter-"
"flight-mode-configuration>` so the vehicle can be driven in :ref:`Manual "
"<manual-mode>` and :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` modes."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`发射机飞行模式开关 <common-rc-transmitter-flight-mode-configuration>`，使车辆可在 "
":ref:`Manual <manual-mode>` 和 :ref:`Acro <acro-mode>` 模式下驾驶。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:16
#: f0b736137e9641a989e3a91149e00144
msgid "Check that the vehicle can be driven in Manual mode."
msgstr "确认车辆可在 Manual 模式下正常驾驶。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:19
#: a44ceb76c1614788946a16b42733b82f
msgid "Tune the Speed and Throttle Controller"
msgstr "调节速度与油门控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:21
#: 87eaa6c04b5c4636bfbf00b1b0a168e0
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions on the :ref:`Tuning Speed and Throttle <rover-"
"tuning-throttle-and-speed>` page.  The high level steps are:"
msgstr "按照 :ref:`速度与油门调参 <rover-tuning-throttle-and-speed>` 页面的说明操作。主要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:23
#: 36832b90711a49a58650355475f4e29d
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in Manual mode in a straight line at between 50% and 80% "
"throttle and use the \"Learn Cruise Speed\" :ref:`auxiliary switch <common-"
"auxiliary-functions>` to capture the :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE "
"<CRUISE_THROTTLE>` and :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED <CRUISE_SPEED>` parameter values"
msgstr ""
"在 Manual 模式下以 50% 至 80% 油门直线行驶车辆，并使用「学习巡航速度」 :ref:`辅助开关 <common-auxiliary-"
"functions>` 捕获 :ref:`CRUISE_THROTTLE <CRUISE_THROTTLE>` 和 :ref:`CRUISE_SPEED"
" <CRUISE_SPEED>` 参数值"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:25
#: b28e1fe613324a4b9ab26d2b5acf594d
msgid ""
"Test and adjust the speed controller gains in real-time while driving in "
"Acro mode"
msgstr "在 Acro 模式驾驶时实时测试并调整速度控制器增益"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:27
#: a476575cb8b14ec0bd9ff925cedbd9b0
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` to 2 (Throttle) to send PID "
"information to the ground station"
msgstr "将 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` 设为 2（油门）以向地面站发送 PID 信息"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:28
#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:43
#: 0b0a3178c8d347a88eb271a13c246bb2 2c09a27c5bfc464cb3d8c25c01df61a4
msgid "On the ground station graph the \"piddesired\" and \"pidachieved\" values"
msgstr "在地面站绘制「piddesired」和「pidachieved」数值图表"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:29
#: 98df7c9897784534b38b18ef95820f9f
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle at various speeds in Acro mode and compare how well "
"pidachieved follows piddesired"
msgstr "在 Acro 模式下以不同速度驾驶车辆，比较 pidachieved 对 piddesired 的跟随效果"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:30
#: b5e35b4acf7140e0b7919fc303d902e1
msgid ""
"Adjust :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>`, :ref:`ATC_SPEED_I <ATC_SPEED_I>` up"
" or down so that piddesired follows pidachieved"
msgstr ""
"上调或下调 :ref:`ATC_SPEED_P <ATC_SPEED_P>`、:ref:`ATC_SPEED_I <ATC_SPEED_I>`，使 "
"piddesired 跟随 pidachieved"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:32
#: 6c552cabbbcb469b8ce1af8364c8b778
msgid ""
"If the vehicle accelerates too quickly or too slowly adjust the "
":ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_MAX>`"
msgstr "若车辆加速过快或过慢，调整 :ref:`ATC_ACCEL_MAX <ATC_ACCEL_MAX>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:35
#: 47b2bfbf327f42519d690fde14a0863b
msgid "Tune the Turn Rate Controller"
msgstr "调节转向速率控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:37
#: b85a6ec0dc4f4e8f98ac21c5ab6365d3
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions on the :ref:`Tuning Steering Rate <rover-tuning-"
"steering-rate>` page.  The high level steps are:"
msgstr "按照 :ref:`转向速率调参 <rover-tuning-steering-rate>` 页面的说明操作。主要步骤如下："

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:39
#: 56fece06596c4980aa5131cb125c1985
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` parameter to be roughly what "
"the vehicle's maximum turn rate is in deg/sec"
msgstr "将 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 参数大致设为车辆最大转向速率（单位：度/秒）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:40
#: ae7c6422e9ef4f42afcd1585959009f2
msgid ""
"Test and adjust the turn rate controller gains in real-time while driving in"
" Acro mode"
msgstr "在 Acro 模式驾驶时实时测试并调整转向速率控制器增益"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:42
#: c5ca700f09174e0f95c5506aa9a5a4d7
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` to 1 (Steering) to send PID "
"information to the ground station"
msgstr "将 :ref:`GCS_PID_MASK <GCS_PID_MASK>` 设为 1（转向）以向地面站发送 PID 信息"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:44
#: 8a23c2b6904f4576bf637bf6ab708c4f
msgid ""
"Drive the vehicle in Acro mode at a medium speed making various wide and "
"tight turns and compare how well pidachieved follows piddesired.  The most "
"important parameter to get right is :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`"
msgstr ""
"在 Acro 模式下以中等速度驾驶车辆，做各种宽幅和急弯，比较 pidachieved 对 piddesired 的跟随效果。最重要的参数是 "
":ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_FF <ATC_STR_RAT_FF>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:46
#: b1b1e88e6c8d458ca8660f8717868945
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` to the :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE "
"<ACRO_TURN_RATE>` value and optionally reduce :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE "
"<ACRO_TURN_RATE>`"
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`ATC_STR_RAT_MAX <ATC_STR_RAT_MAX>` 设为 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE "
"<ACRO_TURN_RATE>` 的值，并可选降低 :ref:`ACRO_TURN_RATE <ACRO_TURN_RATE>`"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:49
#: 8ae5cf2ea83f4ab194f9542bb181c6ed
msgid "Rover QuickTune LUA Script"
msgstr "Rover QuickTune Lua 脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:51
#: ccf5a24c1a0f4cd3ad85dc9748546e5d
msgid ""
"If the autopilot is capable of running :ref:`common-lua-scripts`, instead of"
" manually tuning steering and speed/throttle controllers, it can be done "
"automatically using the `rover-quicktune.lua applet "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.lua>`__. Read its `instruction file "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.md>`_ for setup and use information."
msgstr ""
"若飞控支持运行 :ref:`common-lua-scripts`，可使用 `rover-quicktune.lua 应用程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.lua>`__ 自动完成转向及速度/油门控制器的调参，无需手动操作。请阅读其 `说明文件 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/rover-"
"quicktune.md>`_ 了解设置和使用信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:54
#: 6506f433be404b69a0dedaaf0a8badc3
msgid "Configure Pivot Turns (Skid Steering vehicles only)"
msgstr "配置原地转向（仅限差速转向车辆）"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:56
#: d3cb308a557845949559cddfafa614e9
msgid ""
"If the vehicle uses :ref:`Skid Steering <rover-motor-and-servo-connections-"
"skid-steering>` follow the instructions on the :ref:`Tuning Pivot Turns "
"<rover-tuning-pivot-turns>` page"
msgstr ""
"若车辆采用 :ref:`差速转向 <rover-motor-and-servo-connections-skid-steering>`，请按照 "
":ref:`原地转向调参 <rover-tuning-pivot-turns>` 页面的说明操作"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:59
#: 1a27b4bdf0f04a39b13405c1fdd4a7b8
msgid "Tune the Navigation Controller"
msgstr "调节导航控制器"

#: ../../source/docs/rover-tuning-process.rst:61
#: 0e70f1a2984845f7b0ac4e70e9c7bf3a
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions on the :ref:`Tuning Navigation <rover-tuning-"
"navigation>` page"
msgstr "按照 :ref:`导航调参 <rover-tuning-navigation>` 页面的说明操作"
